{
 "dur": 47.16,
 "lines": [
  {
   "t0": 3.4,
   "t1": 10.76,
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Clara tries to count the keys. She loses count somewhere after forty, and starts again, and loses count again."
  },
  {
   "t0": 10.76,
   "t1": 12.97,
   "who": "B",
   "text": "There are eighty-eight"
  },
  {
   "t0": 12.97,
   "t1": 14.78,
   "who": "N",
   "text": "says the Butler"
  },
  {
   "t0": 14.78,
   "t1": 18.06,
   "who": "B",
   "text": "but nobody finds a key by counting."
  },
  {
   "t0": 18.06,
   "t1": 20.84,
   "who": "piano",
   "notes": [
    18.06,
    19.3
   ]
  },
  {
   "t0": 20.84,
   "t1": 21.64,
   "who": "pause",
   "text": "Pause and try."
  },
  {
   "t0": 21.64,
   "t1": 24.64,
   "who": "N",
   "text": "A true story from music history."
  },
  {
   "t0": 24.64,
   "t1": 32.21,
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Mozart\u2019s piano had only about five octaves. The eighty-eight keys you see came almost a hundred years later."
  },
  {
   "t0": 32.21,
   "t1": 38.12,
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Yet the black keys were already in their twos and threes. The pattern is older than the piano."
  },
  {
   "t0": 38.12,
   "t1": 38.72,
   "who": "pause",
   "text": "Pause and try."
  },
  {
   "t0": 38.72,
   "t1": 40.61,
   "who": "B",
   "text": "The Butler\u2019s note."
  },
  {
   "t0": 40.61,
   "t1": 45.0,
   "who": "B",
   "text": "Twos and threes. Find the group, and you have found the key."
  },
  {
   "t0": 45.0,
   "t1": 47.16,
   "who": "piano",
   "notes": [
    45.0,
    45.62
   ]
  }
 ]
}